        <mxCell id="302" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#f9a825;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="Các loại quan hệ trực tiếp (loai_quan_he=truc_tiep):&lt;br&gt;sua_doi_bo_sung  |  sua_doi  |  bo_sung  |  thay_the  |  bai_bo  |  huy_bo&lt;br&gt;dinh_chinh  |  dinh_chi  |  huong_dan  |  quy_dinh_chi_tiet&lt;br&gt;dan_chieu  |  can_cu  |  keo_dai_hieu_luc  |  ngung_hieu_luc  |  hop_nhat&lt;br&gt;bao_gom_sau_bo_sung  (structural — PRESERVED by --reset-relations)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="400" x="2040" y="662.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a302" edge="1" parent="1" source="57" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#cccccc;" target="302" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="316" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#f9a825;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="Optimization: Single MongoDB scan&lt;br&gt;build_nodes_and_bao_gom_phase()&lt;br&gt;Bước 1 (Nodes) + Bước 2 (BAO_GOM)&lt;br&gt;trong 1 lần đọc MongoDB khi cả 2 đều active&lt;br&gt;(tránh double scan MongoDB IE)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="85" width="380" x="2040" y="460" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a316" edge="1" parent="1" source="55" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#cccccc;" target="316" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="304" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#f9a825;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="Nguyên tắc ưu tiên Algorithm &amp;gt; TVPL:&lt;br&gt;Cypher: OPTIONAL MATCH (head)-[existing]-&amp;gt;(tail)&lt;br&gt;WHERE type(existing) = rel.rel_type&lt;br&gt;→ Chỉ CREATE nếu existing IS NULL." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="77.5" width="400" x="2050" y="1383.75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a304" edge="1" parent="1" source="66" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#cccccc;" target="304" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="305" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#f9a825;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="4 Graph Write Modes:&lt;br&gt;• legacy: ghi trực tiếp, không validate nốt tồn tại&lt;br&gt;• shadow-strict: validate những vẫn ghi tất cả(kể cả lỗi) - vẫn ghi như legacy, chỉ để đánh giá xem strict mode sẽ block bao nhiêu mối quan hệ trước khi thật sự bật strict.&lt;br&gt;• strict-auto-heal: validate; node thiếu → tự tạo từ MongoDB&lt;br&gt;• strict-no-heal: validate; node thiếu → skip + ghi audit&lt;br&gt;Audit output: reports/audit_summary.json + audit_detail.ndjson" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="400" x="2070" y="1627.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a305" edge="1" parent="1" source="68" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#cccccc;" target="305" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="317" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#f9a825;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="Bước tuỳ chọn (sau Bước 3B, trước Enrich):&lt;br&gt;• --reconcile-after-build: GraphReconciliationService&lt;br&gt;  So sánh IE ↔ Neo4j, báo cáo missing/extra edges&lt;br&gt;• --delete-orphan-nodes: xóa DIEU_KHOAN không có BAO_GOM&lt;br&gt;  (VAN_BAN bị xóa khỏi scope)&lt;br&gt;• --reset-relations: xóa status/inferred edges của in-scope nodes&lt;br&gt;  TRƯỚC khi build; preserves bao_gom + bao_gom_sau_bo_sung" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="420" x="2040" y="1940" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="306" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#f9a825;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="BatchProcessor - Checkpoint:&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ghi ID đã xử lý vao logs/checkpoints/ mỗi checkpoint_interval docs để có thể tiếp tục nếu như bị crash chương trình.&lt;br&gt;TẮT tự động khi --parallel-workers &amp;gt; 1 vì CheckpointManager không thread-safe.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="900" x="1080" y="2595" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="307" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#f9a825;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="Thread Safety trong Phase 1:&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;• RelationsExtractor: thread_local =&amp;gt; mỗi worker thread có 1 instance riêng (tránh race condition trên regex state)&lt;br&gt;• _es_cache + _es_cache_lock (Lock): cache kết quả ES lookup cross-document, thread-safe&lt;br&gt;• _lock (RLock): bảo vệ bulk MongoDB write buffer và cập nhật stats&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="900" x="1080" y="2705" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="308" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#f9a825;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="LLM Fallback: Chỉ kích hoạt khi extract_relation_types() trả về rỗng VÀ flag --use-llm=True.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;ES Cache Strategy: shared_cache la cross-doc (toàn batch, thread-safe Lock) =&amp;gt; tránh lặp ES call cho cùng 1 văn bản được nhiều doc tham chiếu. local_cache là per-doc (không cần lock).&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="900" x="1080" y="2830" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="309" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#f9a825;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="Chiến lược tìm văn bản tham chiếu:&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Luật/ Hiến pháp / Bộ luật / =&amp;gt; filter_law_df() trả in-memory CSV — nhanh hơn ES. Nếu không tìm thấy =&amp;gt; _search_law_number_in_es() =&amp;gt; _search_law_title_in_es()&lt;br&gt;• Các loại văn bản khác (Nghị định, Thông tư, Quyết định...) =&amp;gt; search_reference_in_es() trên ES index law_documents_t4 (75% token overlap + date filter + loai_van_ban matching)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="900" x="1080" y="2945" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="310" parent="1" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#f8f9fa;strokeColor=#333333;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="310" width="1960" x="20" y="3360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="311" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fillColor=#37474f;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#37474f;" value="CHÚ THÍCH / LEGEND" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="34" width="1960" x="20" y="3360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="312" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Màu sắc / Hình dạng:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table cellpadding=&quot;5&quot; cellspacing=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#d5e8d4;border:2px solid #82b366;width:28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Bắt đầu / Kết thúc (Ellipse xanh lá)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#dae8fc;border:2px solid #6c8ebf;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Bước xử lý chính — Process (Rectangle xanh dương)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#fff2cc;border:2px solid #d6b656;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Điểm quyết định — Decision (Diamond vàng)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#f8cecc;border:2px solid #b85450;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Cơ sở dữ liệu MongoDB / Elasticsearch (Cylinder hồng)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#e1d5e7;border:2px solid #9673a6;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Cơ sở dữ liệu Neo4j (Cylinder tím)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#ffe6cc;border:2px solid #d79b00;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Bước xử lý TVPL (highlight cam)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#f5f5f5;border:2px dashed #555555;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Nhóm thực thi song song — Parallel group (Dashed border)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#d5e8d4;border:2px solid #82b366;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Cache hit / law_dataframe (Rectangle xanh lá)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="580" x="30" y="3400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="313" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Hướng mũi tên:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;→ Solid: luồng xử lý chính&lt;br&gt;⇢ Dashed: luồng phụ (bypass / skip / optional)&lt;br&gt;⇢ Blue dashed (dày): kết nối phụ thuộc dữ liệu liên phase&lt;br&gt;⇢ Gray dashed: liên kết chú thích với bước tương ứng&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nhãn trên mũi tên:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Có / Không: nhánh quyết định&lt;br&gt;• HIT / MISS: trạng thái cache lookup&lt;br&gt;• Bỏ qua: skip bước TVPL không hợp lệ&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Parallel group (đường viền nét đứt):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Các bước bên trong chạy song song qua ThreadPoolExecutor.&lt;br&gt;Nested parallel: per-clause dùng riêng 8–16 workers.&lt;br&gt;Số workers ngoài = --parallel-workers (default 8)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="420" x="625" y="3400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="314" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Ràng buộc hệ thống:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Phase 1 và Phase 2 là &lt;b&gt;SEQUENTIAL&lt;/b&gt; — Phase 2 đọc output MongoDB IE của Phase 1. Không chạy song song.&lt;br&gt;• Checkpoint &lt;b&gt;DISABLED&lt;/b&gt; khi --parallel-workers &gt; 1 (CheckpointManager không thread-safe).&lt;br&gt;• Không khởi tạo DB driver trực tiếp — luôn dùng ConnectionManager với named connections.&lt;br&gt;• Neo4j: execute_read (queries), execute_write (mutations) + exponential backoff on transient errors.&lt;br&gt;• Bulk MongoDB write buffer = 500 ops → flush khi đầy hoặc kết thúc batch.&lt;br&gt;• --reset-relations: xóa status/inferred edges của in-scope nodes (preserves bao_gom + bao_gom_sau_bo_sung).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;File nguồn chính:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Phase 1: src/extract_relations.py · src/services/relations_processor_service.py · src/domain/extractors/&lt;br&gt;• Distractor filter: src/domain/extractors/distractor_filter.py&lt;br&gt;• Ref resolution: src/services/extraction/reference_resolution_service.py  (src/utils/post_processing.py = backward-compat shim)&lt;br&gt;• Phase 2: src/build_graph.py · src/app/build_graph_app.py · src/services/neo4j_preparation.py&lt;br&gt;• Target resolver: src/services/graph_target_resolver.py&lt;br&gt;• Reconciliation: src/services/graph_reconciliation_service.py&lt;br&gt;• TVPL: src/services/tvpl_relationship_service.py&lt;br&gt;• Write Coordinator: src/services/graph_relationship_write_coordinator.py" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="910" x="1060" y="3400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
